    "v": "unknown",
    "note": "Could not verify the state of the EMV poller in the final 2024 build. The EMV plugin was broken across the community forks for a long period and was only fixed in August 2026, well after Xtreme was archived - so on Xtreme it is at best unverified and quite possibly non-functional."
