  "price_note": "$11.99 for the SKU with the LCD from LilyGO's China warehouse; $16.49 from the Germany warehouse and the US warehouse SKU is out of stock. Tindie lists $10.50. Add ~$8 for a microSD. All-in around $20 - roughly a tenth of a Flipper Zero, for a completely different capability set.",
